                          "text":  "I brought a friend, a small helicopter named Ingenuity. I set it down, backed away, and filmed its first flight. It flew 72 times. It is silent now, and I have driven on.\n\nI know about the ones who came before me: the Vikings, little Sojourner, Spirit, Opportunity, Phoenix, InSight. Every one of them taught my builders something that is now part of me. One day I will go quiet too. Until then, I have work to do.",
